OL,3,GNEWSAMan robbed elderly woman after
OL,4,Aprison release
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prolific thief has been jailed for
OL,7,Frobbing an elderly woman shortly after
OL,8,Fbeing released early from a prison
OL,9,Fsentence for a similar offence.
OL,11,FDaniel Bell targeted the 83-year-old
OL,12,Fwhen she was withdrawing cash at a
OL,13,Fsupermarket in Selby on 6 August.
OL,15,FThe 33-year-old, of no fixed abode, had
OL,16,Falready been sentenced in January for
OL,17,Fsnatching an elderly woman's bag
OL,18,Foutside Marks & Spencer in York and
OL,19,Fknocking her to the ground.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
