OL,3,GNEWSAMan robbed elderly woman after
OL,4,Aprison release
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter pleading guilty to robbery at an
OL,7,Fearlier hearing, Bell was sentenced to
OL,8,Ffour years and four months in prison at
OL,9,FYork Crown Court on Wednesday.
